  "goodToKnow": "Das Kerngeschäft is a company's core business: sich aufs Kerngeschäft konzentrieren (often a sign of selling off other divisions). Related: die Kernkompetenz (core competence), die Kernzielgruppe. Der Kern means core, kernel or pip, and die Kernkraft is nuclear power, which Germany phased out in April 2023. Plural: die Kerngeschäfte."
